          "text": "https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-5190"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "Out-of-bounds write in the streaming decoder component in aws-c-event-stream before 0.6.0 might allow a third party operating a server to cause memory corruption leading to arbitrary code execution on a client application that processes crafted event-stream messages.\n\n\n\nTo remediate this issue, users should upgrade to version 0.6.0 or later.",
          "title": "CVE description"
        }
      ],
